window.LEARN_CONTENT=window.LEARN_CONTENT||{};window.LEARN_CONTENT["a-8fae4d644c83cbb4"]={"zh":"<p><a id=\"consolidate-spreadsheets\"></a></p> <h1 id=\"_1\">汇总多个表格</h1> <p>将多个表格导出文件合并到一份可刷新的工作簿中。</p> <p>向 ChatGPT 提供多个表格导出文件、关联键、目标值、细分定义和报告规则，请它创建一份汇总工作簿，包含清理后的关联结果、图表、洞察、假设、刷新说明和不匹配记录复核。</p> <p><a id=\"best-for\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_2\">适合哪些情况</h2> <ul> <li>需要将多个导出文件合并到一份可更新工作簿中的报告流程。</li> <li>需要明确关联键和目标值的销售漏斗、客户、运营或绩效分析。</li> <li>需要单独复核不匹配记录和刷新假设的团队。</li> </ul> <p><a id=\"skills-plugins\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_3\">技能与插件</h2> <table> <thead> <tr> <th>技能或插件</th> <th>用途</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td><code>$spreadsheets</code></td> <td>检查导出文件、清理数据关联、建立公式，并验证生成的工作簿。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/plugins/tree/main/plugins/google-drive\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">google-drive（需联网）</a></td> <td>阅读 Drive 中获准使用的表格来源和报告模板。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>$documents</code></td> <td>补充清晰的假设、刷新说明和复核摘要。</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p><a id=\"starter-prompt\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_4\">起步提示词</h2> <p>汇总这些导出文件</p> <p>建议模型：<code>gpt-6.1-sol</code> · 建议推理级别：<code>medium</code></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">将随附的表格导出文件汇总到一份可更新的工作簿中。\n\n按 [record or account key] 进行关联。清理重复记录，计算 [metrics or views]，将 [actuals or pipeline] 与 [target] 比较，并创建一个带图表和易读文字洞察的仪表板。\n\n请包含：\n- 假设和刷新说明\n- 用于复核不匹配的关联键或未能正确关联的记录的部分\n- 简短的变更日志\n\n不要捏造关联键，也不要悄悄合并相互冲突的记录。保留原始文件，并返回汇总工作簿供我复核。\n</code></pre> <p><a id=\"related-links\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_5\">关联文档</h2> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://openai.com/academy/how-to-use-codex-for-everyday-work/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">OpenAI Academy：日常工作（需联网）</a></li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-575ba4762ea69b23\">表格技能</a></li> </ul> <blockquote> <p>如需完整文档索引，请参阅 <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt（需联网）</a>。在文档页面 URL 末尾添加 <code>.md</code>，即可获取该页面的 Markdown 版本。</p> </blockquote> <p><a id=\"establish-the-join-and-reporting-rules\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_6\">明确数据关联和报告规则</h2> <p>只有在关联键、字段定义、目标计算方式和重复记录规则都明确时，汇总才比较可靠。提供源导出文件，并要求 ChatGPT 列出无法正确关联的记录，不要让它猜测。</p> <ol> <li>附上导出文件、字段映射说明、目标值和报告要求。</li> <li>确认关联键、重复记录处理规则、统计周期定义和所需的输出视图。</li> <li>使用起始提示词，要求生成带复核部分的可编辑工作簿。</li> <li>检查公式、数据关联、不匹配记录、假设和刷新说明。</li> <li>如果源文件或报告规则有变化，重新运行相关检查。</li> </ol> <p>保留原始导出文件。汇总工作簿应清楚说明哪些行已成功关联、哪些被排除，以及后续刷新依赖哪些假设。</p> <p><a id=\"validate-the-refresh-path\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_7\">验证刷新流程</h2> <p>第一份工作簿准备好后，请 ChatGPT 模拟下一次刷新，并说明哪些步骤可以重复执行，哪些仍需要人工判断。</p> <p><strong>提示词：</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Test the refresh process for this consolidated workbook.\n\nReport:\n\n- inputs that can be replaced without changing the workflow\n- formulas, joins, and charts that update correctly\n- duplicate or mismatched keys\n- assumptions that are not documented\n- rows that need manual review\n- steps that should become a reusable skill or automation\n\nDo not overwrite the source exports or change business definitions.\n</code></pre><div class=\"prompt-translation\"><div class=\"prompt-reference-heading\"><strong>提示词中文参考</strong><button class=\"copy-code copy-prompt-translation\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"复制中文参考\">复制中文</button></div><div class=\"prompt-reference-text\">请测试这份合并工作簿的刷新流程。\n\n报告：\n\n- 哪些输入可以替换，而无需改变工作流\n- 哪些公式、关联和图表能够正确更新\n- 重复或不匹配的键\n- 未记录在文档中的假设\n- 需要人工审阅的行\n- 哪些步骤应整理成可重复使用的技能或自动化\n\n不要覆盖来源导出文件，也不要更改业务定义。</div></div>","en":"<h1 id=\"consolidate-spreadsheets\">Consolidate spreadsheets</h1> <p>Join spreadsheet exports into one refreshable workbook.</p> <p>Give ChatGPT spreadsheet exports, join keys, targets, segment definitions, and reporting rules, then ask it to create a consolidated workbook with cleaned joins, charts, insights, assumptions, refresh instructions, and mismatch review.</p> <h2 id=\"best-for\">Best for</h2> <ul> <li>Reporting workflows that combine multiple exports into one updateable workbook.</li> <li>Pipeline, account, operations, or performance analysis with explicit join keys and targets.</li> <li>Teams that need mismatched records and refresh assumptions isolated for review.</li> </ul> <h2 id=\"skills-plugins\">Skills &amp; Plugins</h2> <table> <thead> <tr> <th>Skill or plugin</th> <th>Why use it</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td><code>$spreadsheets</code></td> <td>Inspect exports, clean joins, build formulas, and validate the resulting workbook.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/plugins/tree/main/plugins/google-drive\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">google-drive (online)</a></td> <td>Read approved spreadsheet sources and reporting templates from Drive.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>$documents</code></td> <td>Add clear assumptions, refresh instructions, and a review summary.</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <h2 id=\"starter-prompt\">Starter prompt</h2> <p>Consolidate these exports</p> <p>Suggested model：<code>gpt-6.1-sol</code> · Suggested reasoning effort：<code>medium</code></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Consolidate the attached spreadsheet exports into one updateable workbook.\n\nJoin on [record or account key]. Clean duplicate records, calculate [metrics or views], compare [actuals or pipeline] with [target], and create a dashboard with charts and plain-English insights.\n\nInclude:\n- assumptions and refresh instructions\n- a review section for mismatched keys or records that did not join cleanly\n- a short change log\n\nDo not invent join keys or silently merge conflicting records. Preserve the original files and return the consolidated workbook for review.\n</code></pre> <h2 id=\"related-links\">Related links</h2> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://openai.com/academy/how-to-use-codex-for-everyday-work/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">OpenAI Academy: Everyday work (online)</a></li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-575ba4762ea69b23\">Spreadsheet skills</a></li> </ul> <blockquote> <p>For the complete documentation index, see <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt (online)</a>. Markdown versions of documentation pages are available by appending <code>.md</code> to the page URL.</p> </blockquote> <h2 id=\"establish-the-join-and-reporting-rules\">Establish the join and reporting rules</h2> <p>Consolidation is safest when the key, field definitions, target calculations, and duplicate rules are explicit. Give ChatGPT the source exports and ask it to surface records that do not join cleanly instead of guessing.</p> <ol> <li>Attach the exports, mapping notes, targets, and reporting requirements.</li> <li>Confirm the join key, duplicate rule, period definitions, and required output views.</li> <li>Run the starter prompt and request an editable workbook with a review section.</li> <li>Inspect formulas, joins, mismatches, assumptions, and refresh instructions.</li> <li>Re-run the checks after any change to the source files or reporting rules.</li> </ol> <p>Keep the original exports unchanged. A useful consolidated workbook makes it easy to tell which rows joined, which were excluded, and which assumptions a future refresh depends on.</p> <h2 id=\"validate-the-refresh-path\">Validate the refresh path</h2> <p>After the first workbook is ready, ask ChatGPT to simulate the next refresh and report which steps are repeatable and which still need a human decision.</p> <p><strong>Prompt:</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Test the refresh process for this consolidated workbook.\n\nReport:\n\n- inputs that can be replaced without changing the workflow\n- formulas, joins, and charts that update correctly\n- duplicate or mismatched keys\n- assumptions that are not documented\n- rows that need manual review\n- steps that should become a reusable skill or automation\n\nDo not overwrite the source exports or change business definitions.\n</code></pre>"};
